            <tr><td><strong>The editor</strong></td><td>TinaCloud. The thing behind <code>/admin</code>. Free plan — <strong>exactly two editor seats.</strong> Editors sign in as <code>connect@brbcbaytown.org</code>; that is a seat, not the owner.</td><td>app.tina.io · project "website"</td><td>Project owned by <code>bakerroadbaptist@gmail.com</code></td></tr>
