            <tr><td><strong>Forms</strong></td><td>Two Planning Center forms: <em>Connection Card</em> (1314833) and <em>Join the Team</em> (1314832). Submissions land in Planning Center People.</td><td>people.planningcenteronline.com → Forms</td><td>The church's Planning Center</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Analytics</strong></td><td>Google Analytics 4, measurement ID <code>G-37WGNT2TFM</code>. The property is named <em>Baker Road Baptist Church</em> (GA account 407158412, property 553104809) and lives in the church's Google Workspace under <code>matt.rose@brbcbaytown.org</code>, not in either Gmail account. Sign in there at analytics.google.com to see reports or add another user (Admin → Property access management). The tag runs on every public page (not on this one), counts visits, and sets its own cookies — disclosed in the privacy policy.</td><td>analytics.google.com</td><td>Owned by the Workspace admin account <code>matt.rose@brbcbaytown.org</code> (confirmed 7 Sept 2026). Sarah Rose's access is through <code>sarah@brbcbaytown.org</code> (Viewer), so reports do not depend on one login.</td></tr>
